          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_san_cha_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Even if Fang Yuan turned his bones into essence iron bones, Soft Bones Gu would still soften them eventually within its radius, leaving him unable to fight back.",
        "chapters": [
          380
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "soft-bones-pressure",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_soft_bones_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After refining human skin Gu, Fang Yuan uses old removal Gu to wash away the modifications from ancient bronze skin, essence iron bones, and golden steel tendons.",
